							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Seems like most speed through the content to get to the end because they keep creating more and more zones.&nbsp; Quit flooding EQ with more zones and fucking revamp or make them better.&nbsp; Small player based spanned among 200+ zones....<br /><br /> <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/banghead2.gif" alt="banghead2" border="0" />
