								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I totally agree with that Rednights. Totally. EQ has SOOO many zones right now that are just wasted space.&nbsp; Zone into any zone that isnt PoP or GoD or LDoN and most likely a /who will be only you. Total ghost-towns and wastes of space.
