								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1016.msg10867#msg10867">Re: Future of EQ</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #36 on:</b> September 06, 2004, 07:11:02 pm &#187;</span></td>
