							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">&nbsp; Speaking of the future, is there even a release date for OoW yet?&nbsp; All I can find is &quot;September&quot;. </div><br />I thought I had seen September 14th as the target date.
