	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg10893"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=52" title="View the profile of Gabus">Gabus</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Drolvarg Guardian<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 276<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/psychotic-day.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								I beat the Internet. The end guy was hard.<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=52"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1016.msg10893#msg10893"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1016.msg10893#msg10893">Re: Future of EQ</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #37 on:</b> September 07, 2004, 10:12:31 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Eq will not completely die. There are too many hardcore, loyal fans who will play this game till someone pulls the plug. What they (sony) will have to do once EQII comes out tho, is likely consolidate the servers, so you have a decent chance of grouping. Right now the server population is all jammed at the top end. With the reduction of the population in total, and the majority of the server at the high end ) 57+, it is already hard to find groups in the 20 - 50 range. <br /><br />This has the effect of encouraging activities like PL, since there is simply no one to play with in the 20 - 50 level range, consistantly, or none of the correct classes anyway. Even if you begin with the altruistic intention of starting over, non-twinked, and no PL, that dream hits cold reality when there is no-one to play with. The game at all levels is designed for groups, whether its grinding or raiding. Soloing was an abberation that verant never calculated for, tried to kill, and eventually found they had to embrace as part of the world they created. (Look at the early nerfs to necros, as proof that Verant hated solo play)<br /><br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" /><a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=139779" target="_blank">Gabus Magelo Profile</a>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg11032"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=285" title="View the profile of Serepi">Serepi</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Guild Officer<br />
								Splitpaw Gnoll<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 66<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://cfusionpm.com/misc/pulltoopen.gif" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								It&#039;s all about the tail, baby!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=285"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1016.msg11032#msg11032"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1016.msg11032#msg11032">Re: Future of EQ</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #38 on:</b> September 10, 2004, 02:18:21 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							No, it probably won&#039;t die - but there will come a time when there&#039;s a lack of active accounts, and they have to collapse servers.&nbsp; It&#039;s my perception that there isn&#039;t the same number of new accounts as there is accounts being closed, a net decline in the number of accounts.&nbsp; There&#039;s no true newbies anymore.&nbsp; Anyone below 65 has a 65 druid/shaman/cleric sitting behind them PLing them.<br /><br />At least that was true a few months ago when I quit the game.&nbsp; I think the new games (especially WoW) will be the beginning of the end.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />Serepi Serein<br />Officer, Hegemony Guild<br />&quot;Delenda est Carthago&quot;
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
